updated_at: "2026-10-27T06:25:34.318Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: Hound no longer lints generated dist/ output; no other lint or gate changes
comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-27T06:05:51.347Z",codex-agent,"Plan: copy the documented pm-slack .hound.yml configuration, disabling only Hound JSHint. Preserve package lint and release gates. Verify the configuration fails when reverted, run both release gates with isolated Git identity and at most two test workers, regenerate the changelog, and open an unmerged PR. Item remains open for orchestrator verification."
  "2026-10-27T06:06:02.481Z",codex-agent,"Configuration revert proof: the focused Node assertion passes with .hound.yml present, fails when the new file is removed, then passes after restoring its exact bytes. No source behavior or package gates change."
  "2026-10-27T06:25:32.802Z",codex-agent,"Validation complete: focused configuration assertion and both unchanged release:check gates passed under isolated Git identity with at most two test workers. Changelog regenerated from fetched tags; final changelog:check follows all tracker writes. No lint, gate, source, dependency or generated dist changes. Hound service behavior will be observable on the PR; no merge authorized. Measured test counts: npm: 377 tests in each full suite; gate exit 0; bun: 377 tests in each full suite; gate exit 0."
